        {
          "id": 1247156516,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Bonus point we can use `@` instead of `[AT]` because the embedded resource can't be scraped (although it could be done in code too).\n\nI chose to commit it just to avoid adding CMake code to generate the qrc file but I may look into that.",
